  "html": "<h1>Newline Collapse</h1>\n<p>This paragraph is soft-wrapped across several source lines that Confluence would otherwise render as hard breaks, so they collapse to spaces.</p>\n<ac:structured-macro ac:name=\"code\" ac:schema-version=\"1\"><ac:plain-text-body><![CDATA[code lines\nkeep their\nnewlines]]></ac:plain-text-body></ac:structured-macro><p>A final soft-wrapped paragraph.</p>\n",
